# Cline and Roo Odoo Workspace Rules

Use this repository as a project-instruction workspace, not as an assumed native skill registry.

## Canonical instruction

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and use it as the canonical repository instruction file.

## Host note

2. Do not assume `skills/`, `agents/`, `workflows/`, or `rules/` are auto-registered native features.

## Setup note

3. Use `SETUP.md` only when the task is installation or runtime configuration.
